{"title":"2017 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_BETTER!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK BETTER!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many ordered pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is a positive real number and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> is an integer between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f37626d49b4082c9102bf930bca51277ff2eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />, inclusive, satisfy the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/a/41a72b6421a07fbc143fd3395e4d4f127479b174.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_b a)^{2017}=\\log_b(a^{2017})?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"197\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/84094ce7e7cfe509ed4b01b908816b6da2949e57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 198\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 199\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 398\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 399\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 597$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"442\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By the properties of logarithms, we can rearrange the equation to read <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/f/61f7420950be368537019af630a6a5211fbe675f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2017}=2017x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"108\" height=\"15\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/d/f0d8cd5d80b686350cb965284eda805574719983.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\log_b a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/7470aeade5f47b768b503c1547f7e7cbf4540361.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />, we may divide by it and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/b/8abffee04a7f764b732d794187e96e84dee13309.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{2016}=2017$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" />, which implies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/6/2e6b62c88bfce6097063806b817127b088043249.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\pm \\root{2016}\\of{2017}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"118\" height=\"18\" />. Hence, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possible values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, namely \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/4/4a4b102daf67f32fa414ab464cf8c24c8b5102a7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=0,\\qquad x=2017^{\\frac1{2016}},\\, \\text{and}\\quad  x=-2017^{\\frac1{2016}}.\\]\" width=\"353\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e1caeb47b395be37894dadc747fdd04e00c16d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_b a=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"79\" height=\"19\" /> is equivalent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f40914c53c366d8c20ec5c64a4340a5ed3243df5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b^x$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, each possible value <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> yields exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/3/0f31ff033089cb9cfa5a6ce6cd9a0ce6b5c57422.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$199$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> solutions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/3/963a27195c32f1708f62bb2c0e82add2d45486dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b,a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, as we can assign <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f40914c53c366d8c20ec5c64a4340a5ed3243df5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b^x$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" /> to each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/3/713da23ee5c6dfc40cbda4683597fa3b499b51fa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2,3,\\dots,200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"125\" height=\"16\" />. In total, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/7/e2771d3bf37a7b22fdd05c29c38d167ea0a1420c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3\\cdot 199=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) } 597}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"146\" height=\"28\" /> solutions.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_BETTER.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_BETTER!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK BETTER!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK BETTER!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/hBqRcXa_xqE\">https://youtu.be/hBqRcXa_xqE</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid blac